SUMMARY:Fused Glass: Summer Scene Plate Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Design and create a beautiful summer-themed glass plate!\nAre you ready for summer? Think of the cottage or a scene by the lake. Millean Kung will guide you through creating a 6” x 6” plate made entirely of glass. You will learn about the various types of glass\, glass tools\, and techniques used.\n\nAll materials will be provided. This course welcomes beginners.\n\nPlease note: Participants’ creations will be fired off-site and will be ready for pick up in about 4 – 6 weeks. \n\nSaturday\, August 8\, 1 to 3 p.m.\nPublic $115\, TBG Members $110 (plus applicable taxes and fees)\n\nAbout Millean Kung\nBorn and raised in Toronto\, Millean discovered pottery and glass art more than 10 years ago. Currently\, she is a member of the of the Potter’s Studios in Scarborough and is involved in the Small Business Arts Mentorship Program at Glasstronomy Studios in Markham. Since retiring from education\, Millean has devoted her time to her pottery and glass art. She is the sole proprietor of her business\, “1 in a Millean”\, and participates in a number of Arts and Crafts Shows.\n\nMillean also loves to garden and is a member and a volunteer at the Toronto Botanical Garden. To keep her schedule busy\, she enjoys cooking and baking. \n\n\nJoin Toronto Botanical Garden\n\nJoin the Toronto Botanical Garden (TBG) as a member to get a discount on this program\, upcoming events and classes\, and free parking. A TBG membership helps you deepen your knowledge and connection to the natural world\, become a part of a dynamic community of plant people\, and be inspired! Become a member! \n\n\nAdditional Program Information\n\n\n\nPlease review our Refund Policy and Terms of Agreement.\nFor more information on accessibility at the garden please review our Accessibility Features webpage. If you have any accessibility requirements during your program please email programsupport@torontobotanicalgarden.ca.\nTo learn more about the Toronto Botanical Garden and our programs\, please review our list of Frequently Asked Questions.
URL:https://torontobotanicalgarden.ca/event/fused-glass-summer-scene-plate-workshop/
LOCATION:Toronto Botanical Garden\, 777 Lawrence Ave E\, Toronto\, ON\, M3C 1P2\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Art
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://torontobotanicalgarden.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2fac9218072008183fc7866ef1e5bf90.jpg
END:VEVENT
